Subject: winealsa: report USB MIDI paths and identify Push 3

Report a USB device path for each ALSA MIDI port. Store only the vendor and product IDs, then build the path when an application asks for it.

Give the first 2982:1969 port the device name that Push3.exe expects. Every other MIDI device keeps its existing name. Route input device IDs through the same physical-message path that output devices use.

